  "prefLabel": "Phy 401.05 Contact hour",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 401.05 “Contact hour” means a unit of continuing professional education equal to one tenth of a continuing education unit when continuing education is reported in terms of continuing education units.\n\nSource. #9456, eff 4-17-09; renumbered by #10061 (from Phy 401.02); ss by #12088, eff 1-20-17",
